  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Wukumbuso 29",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaghano ja BWANA na Waisraeli andenyi ya isanga ja Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha ni malagho gha Ilaghano ja BWANA ijo oremlaghirieghe Musa ubonye na wandu wa Israeli andenyi ya isanga ja Moabu, kula na jija ilaghano orebonyereghe nawo aja Mghondi ghwa Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Musa ukawiwanga wandu wose wa Israeli ukawizera: “Mwamerie kuwona mmbeni maza rose BWANA oreribonyereghe kwa mzuri wa Misri, na kwa wadumiki wake, na kwa isanga jake jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morewonieghe makabo mabaa, alama na mashiniko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hata idime, BWANA waduagha usemnekie akili retambukilwa, angu meso ghewona, angu madu ghesikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namlongozere miaka mirongo ina kireti; ndemchefuilwa ni nguwo, hata vadu venyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndemorekoghe na vindo veja, angu divei, hata chofi, ela BWANA oremnekieghe vindo eri mpate kumanya angu uo ni BWANA Mlungu onyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesi diendavika aha, Sihoni mzuri wa Heshboni na Ogu mzuri wa Bashani werefumieghe kulwa nesi, ela dikawisima;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dikawada isanga jawo na kujineka kichuku cha Reubeni, na cha Gadi, na nusu ya kichuku cha Manase jikaie ifwa jawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 32.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo mlindie kubonya malagho gha ilaghano iji, eri mpate kuwona nicha kwa maza rose m'bonyagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyo mmbose moko aha kimusi imbiri ya BWANA Mlungu onyu idime. Vilongozi va vichuku venyu, waghosi wenyu, na wabaa wenyu; wandu wose wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wenyu, waka wenyu na waghenyi wemara-mara wiko aghadi konyu, awo wimshoiagha mbande, na kumdaia machi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moko aha idime mpate kubonya ilaghano ja ighemi na BWANA Mlungu onyu, ijo ifwane mujinughe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri upate kum'bonya mkaie wandu wake idime, nao ukaie Mlungu onyu sa iji koni orelaghirieghe na kughema kwa weke ndeyo Abrahamu, na Isaaka, na Jakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata si inyo mmbeni muekeri BWANA wawuyabonya ilaghano iji ja ighemi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela waawuyabonya chiaimweri nesi diwose dikwanye aha kimusi imbiri yake idime na awo wichaavalwa konyuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyo mwaichi seji diduekaia isanga ja Misri, na seji dichee dikiidia aghadi ya iro mbari zima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwawonie vilambo vawo va kisha werekoghe navo; milimu yawo ya midi na magho, na feza na dhahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkulindie, isechekaia mndungi onyu aghadi konyu wa womi angu wa waka, angu kinyumba, angu kichuku kughaluka na kumsigha BWANA Mlungu odu, uendetasa milungu ya ija mbari; uchekaia sa mudi ghuvagha matunda gha sumu, ghibirie aghadi konyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Waeb. 12.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mndungi onyu uko aha idime usikiragha malagho gha ilaghano ijo ja ighemi, nao uhoreshe ngolo yake ukighamba, wei ukeduasikira agho malagho na kughilisha ngolo yake ndewonagha ilagho jingi. Ilagho ijo jichareda kutota kwa wose wiboie na wizamie wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ndechaamfuya wughoma uo mundu. Wulalo ghwaro machu gha BWANA ghichaaka sa modo aighu ya mundu uo, na njowe riandikilo andenyi ya chuo ichi, richambwada; na BWANA uchajiinja irina jake ndoenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA uchammbika kula na mbari ya Israeli, upate makabo kunughana na njowe rose ra ilaghano riandikilo andenyi ya chuo ichi cha sharia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wana wenyu wa kivalwa chichagha, na waghenyi wifumagha isanga ja kula, wichawona makabo ghose BWANA oreghitumieghe kujikaba ijo isanga, kwa matiriro ghose na makongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuwa rose richasighwa nduu, rilungurilo ni kibiriti na munyu na maivu gha modo; ndejichaawalwa hata kubukwa ni isaka jingi. Jichakaia sa mizi ya Sodoma na Gomora, Adma na Zeboiimu iyo BWANA oreitoteshereghe kwa machu ghake na kubia kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 19.24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mbari rose richakotia, ‘Kwaki BWANA ujibonyere iji isanga huwu? Niki chishekerie machu ghake kukaia mabaa huwu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wandu wichatumbulia, ‘Ni angu wandu waro werejisighieghe ilaghano ja BWANA, Mlungu wa weke ndee, ijo orebonyereghe nawo iji orewiredieghe kufuma isanga ja Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
